Sorry, didn't think I was being so opaque (unclear).

In the newsgroup rec.humour.oracle, you may mail a question to the
all-knowing oracle, and the oracle will post an answer.  (Sometime 
later, you will be asked to provide an answer to someone else's 
question.)

The oracle seems to have a short temper, and may ZOT the supplicant
if he/she has not grovelled sufficiently.  For a clearer explanation of 
what a ZOT is, you'd have to read the group.

I thought that in a game like nethack, which is developed by various
people on the net, we should perhaps make our oracle a little more
like the one in rec.humour.oracle.

